            <p>
<ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://mdsearchlight.com/injury-safety-and-violence/facial-nerve-intratemporal-trauma-injury-to-face-nerves-in-the-skull/?utm_source=pubmedlink&#x00026;utm_campaign=MDS&#x00026;utm_content=21559">Click here for a simplified version.</ext-link>
